==Location and Uses==
==={{BotW|-}}===
Roasted Armoranths are a type of [[Roasted Food]]. They are the result of [[Armoranth]]s that have made contact with [[Fire]] or [[Scorching Climate]]s.<ref>{{Cite Guide|BotW Piggyback|page= 295}}</ref> The plant's roasted fibers are said to be hard and chewy, but still easy to eat.<ref name="Inventory"></ref> [[Link]] can heal half a [[Heart]] by eating a Roasted Armoranth.

